  "name": "Question 19",
  "problem": "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$N=[\\begin{aligned}23 & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}].$",
  "worked_solution": "Let's start by writing the matrix $N-\\lambda I:$\n\ufeff\ufeff\ufeff\n\n$$\nN-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}23-\\lambda  & -8 \\\\ 0 & 0-\\lambda \\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(N-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(N-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}23-\\lambda  & -8 \\\\ 0 & -\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (23-\\lambda )(-\\lambda )-0\\cdot (-8) & =0 \\\\ \\lambda (\\lambda -23) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =0$ and $\\lambda =23.$\n\n**Note:** The eigenvalues of a triangular (or diagonal) matrix are the entries on the main diagonal.",
